{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A counter increases every second. You must stop this counter as close to 1000 as possible without exceeding it. The more times you try, the more difficult it will be.\u00a0The speed will increase and the machine's tolerance will decrease until you lose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap-To-1000 is a casual  game,the goal si simply to stop at 1000 and never exceed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Do you have reflexes?</u></strong>\u00a0<strong>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop count at 1000, one time is simple... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple times?! Impossible (Really?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Make it close!</u></strong>\u00a0:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More you are near to 1000, best is your score\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The machine will try to confuse you!</u></strong>\u00a0<strong>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more successful you are, the harder your performance will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rewards up for grabs!</u></strong>\u00a0<strong>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score 1000, get a bonus, and make your game easier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Are you better than your friends?</u></strong>\u00a0<strong>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your score with your Steam friends</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296900?t=1748621814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296900/b424071d8c2a6ca3635858a2aa7150dde72e40c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748621814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296900/034585f442963becba0ac5cdbd4fa146a595092c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748621814","capsule_imagev5":"